- Runtime portability: `skills/skill-author/references/runtime-portability.md`.
- Community-skill source note: `skills/skill-author/references/community-skill-research-sources.md`.
- Skill collision and routing evidence audit: `skills/skill-author/scripts/skill-description-audit.ts`.
- Decision trail: `docs/decisions/2026-06-06-001-decisions-skill-decision-log.md`.
- Archived agent-native skill source: `skills/archive/create-agent-native-skill/SKILL.md`.
- Context advisor: `skills/context-advisor/SKILL.md`.

